  "question": {
    "text": "In an atom, two electrons revolve around the nucleus in circular orbits of radii r and 4r. The ratio of the time taken by them <math>\r <mrow>\r  <msub>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>(T</mtext></mrow>\r   <mtext>2</mtext>\r  </msub>\r  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>:</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>\r   <mtext>T</mtext>\r   <mtext>1</mtext>\r  </msub>\r  <mtext>)</mtext></mrow>\r</math>\r to complete one revolution is"
  },
